<hr><br>

<details><summary><span style="display: inline-block ; height: 30px ; width: 40px ; background: transparent url(&quot;https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/sprites/pokemonicons-sheet.png?v16&quot;) no-repeat scroll -360px -2580px"></span>When I play a shiny Pokemon card, does the Pokedex get updated automatically?</summary>
<p>No. Updates are done manually by the professor when she:
<li>spots a new shiny Pokemon displayed in the room.
<li>reviews user submissions.</p></details>

<br><details><summary><span style="display: inline-block ; height: 30px ; width: 40px ; background: transparent url(&quot;https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/sprites/pokemonicons-sheet.png?v16&quot;) no-repeat scroll -360px -2580px"></span>How can I help updating the Pokedex?</summary>
<p>Fill in <a style="text-decoration:none; color: silver" href="https://forms.gle/pM7vTMbSqZVdWFQ88">the Pokemon submission form</a>. You are free to submit yours and other users' shiny Pokemon.</p></details>

<br><details><summary><span style="display: inline-block ; height: 30px ; width: 40px ; background: transparent url(&quot;https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/sprites/pokemonicons-sheet.png?v16&quot;) no-repeat scroll -360px -2580px"></span>What Pokemon do the Pokedex accept?</summary>
<p>The Pokedex only register Pokemon which is in its base form and have a positive dex number.</p></details>

<br><details><summary><span style="display: inline-block ; height: 30px ; width: 40px ; background: transparent url(&quot;https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/sprites/pokemonicons-sheet.png?v16&quot;) no-repeat scroll -360px -2580px"></span>What are the games where shiny Pokemon can be played?</summary>
<p><li>Axew's Battle Cards
<li>Blissey's Egg Cards
<li>Bulbasaur's Uno
<li>Shuckle's Defense Cards
<li>Stakataka's Card Tower</p></details>

<br><details><summary><span style="display: inline-block ; height: 30px ; width: 40px ; background: transparent url(&quot;https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/sprites/pokemonicons-sheet.png?v16&quot;) no-repeat scroll -360px -2580px"></span>Is there a condensed version of the Pokedex's link?</summary>
<p><a style="text-decoration:none; color: silver" href="https://tinyurl.com/gc-shiny-pokedex">https://tinyurl.com/gc-shiny-pokedex</a>
<br><a style="text-decoration:none; color: silver" href="https://rentry.co/project-bouquets">https://rentry.co/project-bouquets</a></p></details>

<br><details><summary><span style="display: inline-block ; height: 30px ; width: 40px ; background: transparent url(&quot;https://play.pokemonshowdown.com/sprites/pokemonicons-sheet.png?v16&quot;) no-repeat scroll -360px -2580px"></span>Is the Pokedex officially affiliated with the Game Corner room?</summary>
<p>No. The Pokedex is purely a passion project founded by one regular user with the Game Corner room owners' permissions for it to be hosted.</p></details>


 



